<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Bus first half net down.</title>
<headline>Singapore Bus first half net down.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  23.66   vs   32.80</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	     32.00   vs   44.00</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)		5.00   vs    5.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			   293.18   vs  254.03</p>
<p>    Investment income		 14.16   vs   13.07</p>
<p>    Interest/other income	   12.62   vs   10.70</p>
<p>    Interest expense		   2.25   vs    5.16</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization     46.98   vs   36.75</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    35.38   vs   45.08</p>
<p>    Tax				    9.20   vs   12.17</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)		  2.53   vs    0.11</p>
<p>    Dividend pay date:     October 22, 1996</p>
<p>    Last day books open:   October 9, 1996</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Singapore Bus Service (1978) Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
